---
title: "invest (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check contract not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_timing: block.timestamp >= startTime AND block.timestamp <= endTime
    q_check_timing --> q_check_amount: investAmount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_check_amount --> q_verify_sig: verify Legion signer signature
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_key: sealedBidPublicKey == auction publicKey
    q_check_key --> q_check_salt: salt == uint256(msg.sender)
    q_check_salt --> q_transfer: bidToken.transferFrom(msg.sender, address(this), investAmount)
    q_transfer --> q_store_bid: store encryptedAmountOut for investor
    q_store_bid --> q_update_position: investedCapital[msg.sender] += investAmount
    q_update_position --> q_update_total: totalCapitalInvested += investAmount
    q_update_total --> [*]: emit Invested event

    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract is paused
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert ContractPaused
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: outside active period
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert NotInActivePeriod
    q_check_amount --> q_revert_amount: amount < minimum
    q_revert_amount --> [*]: revert BelowMinimumInvestment
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: invalid signature
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_key --> q_revert_key: wrong public key
    q_revert_key --> [*]: revert InvalidSealedBidPublicKey
    q_check_salt --> q_revert_salt: salt != investor address
    q_revert_salt --> [*]: revert InvalidSalt

    note right of q_store_bid
        INV-001: investedCapital[investor] increases by exactly investAmount
        INV-002: totalCapitalInvested increases by exactly investAmount
        INV-003: encrypted bid uses auction public key ensuring only private key holder can decrypt
        INV-004: salt == uint256(msg.sender) binds bid to investor address
        INV-005: signature prevents unauthorized invest calls
    end note
